{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_open_questions", "label": "open-questions.md", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/open-questions.md", "source_location": "L1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_open_questions_no_silent_decisions", "label": "\u041d\u0435 \u0440\u0435\u0448\u0430\u0442\u044c \u043c\u043e\u043b\u0447\u0430: \u0432\u043e\u043f\u0440\u043e\u0441\u044b \u0437\u0430\u043a\u0440\u044b\u0432\u0430\u044e\u0442\u0441\u044f \u043e\u0431\u0441\u0443\u0436\u0434\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435\u043c \u0438 ADR", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/open-questions.md", "source_location": "L3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every open question must be closed via discussion with the owner and recorded as an ADR; each question is tagged with the stage by which it must be closed."}, {"id": "docs_open_questions_live_stroke_details", "label": "\u0414\u0435\u0442\u0430\u043b\u0438 \u00ab\u0436\u0438\u0432\u043e\u0433\u043e \u0448\u0442\u0440\u0438\u0445\u0430\u00bb (\u043e\u0431\u0432\u043e\u0434\u043a\u0438, \u0441\u0442\u0440\u0435\u043b\u043a\u0438 \u043c\u0435\u0436\u0434\u0443 \u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e\u043a\u0430\u043c\u0438)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/open-questions.md", "source_location": "L7", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Open: outlines around several words, arrows between words on different lines; to be resolved on a prototype. Stage 1."}, {"id": "docs_open_questions_dseditor_demo_xcuitest_crash", "label": "\u0418\u0437\u0432\u0435\u0441\u0442\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u0434\u0435\u0444\u0435\u043a\u0442 \u0434\u0435\u043c\u043e DSEditor: \u0432\u044b\u043b\u0435\u0442 \u043f\u043e\u0434 XCUITest", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/open-questions.md", "source_location": "L8", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Demo app crashes in UIKit (_delayTouchesForEvent, nil insert) on tap in text when palette is in safeAreaInset; real app passes UI tests. Crash-bisect showed no editor part is required; bare EditorView in app process (-bareEditorProbe, ios-app c44dfa6) works, so defect is in demo process/project. Since 2026-10-27 crash also on simple text tap (run 160); owner decided to move demo tap UI tests into known-crash step; real coverage via ios-app tests. Needs manual device check."}, {"id": "docs_open_questions_free_drawing_threshold", "label": "\u0421\u0432\u043e\u0431\u043e\u0434\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u0440\u0438\u0441\u0443\u043d\u043e\u043a \u0432\u0434\u0430\u043b\u0438 \u043e\u0442 \u0442\u0435\u043a\u0441\u0442\u0430 (\u043f\u043e\u0440\u043e\u0433 3 em)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/open-questions.md", "source_location": "L9", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "PROPOSED by coordinator 2026-10-25 (strokes.md \u00a74): stroke further than 3 em from lines binds wholly to nearest paragraph and moves with it without stretching per letter; needs confirmation on iPad and threshold tuning."}, {"id": "docs_open_questions_craft_mvp_split", "label": "\u0420\u0430\u0437\u0431\u0438\u0432\u043a\u0430 \u0444\u0443\u043d\u043a\u0446\u0438\u0439 Craft \u043d\u0430 MVP / \u043f\u043e\u0441\u043b\u0435 MVP (D-41)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/open-questions.md", "source_location": "L13", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "PROPOSED; review spec/12-craft-features.md. Before stage 2."}, {"id": "docs_open_questions_server_hosting_and_domain", "label": "\u0425\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0438\u043d\u0433 \u0441\u0435\u0440\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0430 \u0438 \u0434\u043e\u043c\u0435\u043d (D-40)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/open-questions.md", "source_location": "L17", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Deferred until the user buys a VPS. Before stage 3."}, {"id": "docs_open_questions_silent_push_bg_sync", "label": "\u0422\u0438\u0445\u0438\u0435 \u043f\u0443\u0448\u0438 APNs \u0434\u043b\u044f \u0444\u043e\u043d\u043e\u0432\u043e\u0439 \u0441\u0438\u043d\u0445\u0440\u043e\u043d\u0438\u0437\u0430\u0446\u0438\u0438 iOS", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/open-questions.md", "source_location": "L18", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "PROPOSED by ios-core stream 2026-10-25: BGAppRefreshTask alone can delay cross-device edits by hours; server sends contentless APNs silent push at most once per N minutes, app performs short sync. Requires push token registration, APNs key, rate limit, token removal on logout/revoke. No content in push so E2E unaffected. Open: before/after beta; Web Push for web."}, {"id": "docs_open_questions_handwriting_format_png", "label": "\u0424\u043e\u0440\u043c\u0430\u0442 \u0440\u0443\u043a\u043e\u043f\u0438\u0441\u0438 \u0434\u043b\u044f \u0430\u0433\u0435\u043d\u0442\u0430 \u2014 PNG (D-11)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/open-questions.md", "source_location": "L25", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "PROPOSED. Before stage 5."}, {"id": "docs_open_questions_mcp_toolset", "label": "\u041d\u0430\u0431\u043e\u0440 \u0438\u043d\u0441\u0442\u0440\u0443\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0442\u043e\u0432 MCP", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/open-questions.md", "source_location": "L26", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "PROPOSED in spec/09-agents-api.md. Before stage 5."}, {"id": "docs_open_questions_app_store_encryption_export", "label": "\u041e\u0442\u0432\u0435\u0442 \u043e \u0448\u0438\u0444\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0438 \u0434\u043b\u044f App Store (\u044d\u043a\u0441\u043f\u043e\u0440\u0442\u043d\u044b\u0439 \